      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "description": "Actual PVC disk usage from kubelet volume stats vs the 50Gi claim (zot-storage-pvc) - the ground truth backstop against zot's own self-reported total above. Depends on this cluster's kubelet/cAdvisor scrape exposing kubelet_volume_stats_*; if it shows \"No data\", that job isn't scraped here and zot's self-reported total is the only storage signal.",
